WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.952
Moving up to the next class. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:05.952 --> 00:00:10.608
It is the same school building, but a new room.

3
00:00:10.608 --> 00:00:16.272
We find our new room number. It is on the timetable.

4
00:00:16.272 --> 00:00:22.680
The timetable is on the wall. We can take a photo of it with our phone.

5
00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:27.648
We walk the new route once before the first day if we can.

6
00:00:27.648 --> 00:00:33.744
Some subjects move rooms too. The timetable shows which.

7
00:00:33.744 --> 00:00:39.480
The new teacher knows the room. We can ask them anything.

8
00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:44.856
After one week, the new route feels like the old route.

9
00:00:44.856 --> 00:00:53.064
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

